 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Available-to-Promise Processing (6LJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A product availability check can be executed for planned orders, production orders, deliveries, sales orders, and stock transport orders, resulting in the order document containing one or more confirmed schedule lines.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">If the available quantity of a material is insufficient to fulfill requirements, rescheduling can be performed for sales orders or stock transport orders.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute a product availability check at order creation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute rescheduling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor product availability</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute a product availability check at order creation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute rescheduling</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display if ordered products can be delivered in time and quantity</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display when and how much of the ordered product is delivered​</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Fine-tune and optimize confirmations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor product availability</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>可承诺量处理 (6LJ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">可以对计划订单、生产订单、交货、销售订单和库存调拨单执行产品可用性检查，从而生成包含一个或多个已确认计划行的订单凭证。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果物料的可用数量不足以满足需求，则可以对销售订单或库存调拨单执行重新计划。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在订单创建时执行产品可用性检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行重新计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控产品可用性</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio404601cdebcd454a866d60ad9ad71284__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在订单创建时执行产品可用性检查</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行重新计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示订购的产品是否可以按时间和数量交货。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示订购产品的交货时间和数量​</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">微调和优化确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控产品可用性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
